# Patches are consumed by `git apply` and `patch`, both of which reject CRLF context lines, so they
# must always be checked out with LF regardless of the platform.  Without this, a Windows checkout
# writes CRLF and every XNU patch fails with "patch does not apply".
*.patch text eol=lf
patches/** text eol=lf

# Everything else keeps whatever the toolchain writes.
